# The certificate of the `η*²` step minorant: every number, checked by the kernel

GENERATED by a script outside the repository (exact `Fraction` arithmetic mirroring each decided
predicate); nothing depends on it, because every claim about the data is ONE `decide +kernel`
over `ℚ`, and the data are natural numbers over fixed powers of ten:

* the grid `g_j = h_{j mod 32}·2^{⌊j/32⌋}` (`gN`, `gQ`; 32 points per octave from
  `g_0 = 0.1225 = 49·0.0025`, so `g_{j+32} = 2g_j` by definition, `gQ_dbl`), increasing
  everywhere (`hL_ok`, `gN_lt`);
* `el_j ≤ e^{−g_j²/2} ≤ eh_j` at the 208 + 1 grid points (`base_ok`, `chain_ok`: the
  `SC.StepOK` condition of `SC.exp_chain` at every step);
* the 146 cells `(a_c, a_{c+1}]`, `a_c = g_c/49`, `t ∈ [0.0025, 0.0591]`: `0 ≤ S_c` and
  `m_c ≤ (4S_c)²` with `S_c = SC.cellS` (`cells_ok`);
* the Abel sum with `θ` constants `0.92079` and `1.11`: `SC.abelQ ≥ 0.0153` (`abel_ok`).
-/

